$T1> ALTER REPLICATION REP1 FLUSH WAIT 60;
Alter success.
$T1> ALTER REPLICATION REP1 STOP;
Alter success.
$T1> DROP REPLICATION REP1;
Drop success.
$T1> DROP TABLE t1;
Drop success.


